---
---
<!-- Light editorial section — colour-blocked against the navy canvas -->
<section id="goal" class="bg-brand-white py-28 px-4 md:px-[5vw] max-[768px]:py-20">
  <div class="max-w-[980px] mx-auto">

    <!-- Header -->
    <p data-animate class="mb-4 text-[0.72rem] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.26em] text-brand-blue">
      <span data-i18n="no">Fremtidens målinger</span><span data-i18n="en">The future of measurement</span>
    </p>
    <h2 data-animate class="m-0 mb-20 font-display text-[clamp(1.9rem,3.4vw,2.8rem)] font-bold leading-[1.1] tracking-[-0.02em] text-brand-navy max-[768px]:mb-12">
      <span data-i18n="no">Vår løsning</span><span data-i18n="en">Our solution</span>
    </h2>

    <!-- ── 2-col: description text + editorial product image ───── -->
    <div class="mb-24 grid grid-cols-1 items-center gap-14 md:grid-cols-2 md:gap-20 max-[768px]:mb-16">

      <div data-animate class="space-y-6">
        <p class="m-0 text-[1.02rem] leading-[1.85] text-brand-navy/70">
          <span data-i18n="no" set:html={'En sentral målsetning for Industri 4.0 er heldekkende trådløs overvåking, men infrastrukturen henger etter. Kabling koster opp mot <strong class="font-semibold text-brand-navy">1 200 kr/m</strong> og er en hyppig feilkilde.'} />
          <span data-i18n="en" set:html={'A central goal of Industry 4.0 is comprehensive wireless monitoring, but the infrastructure lags behind. Cabling costs up to <strong class="font-semibold text-brand-navy">1,200 NOK/m</strong> and is a frequent point of failure.'} />
        </p>
        <p class="m-0 text-[1.02rem] leading-[1.85] text-brand-navy/70">
          <span data-i18n="no" set:html={'Eldion omdanner tapt spillvarme til strøm. Vi forvandler tradisjonelle kablede måleinstrumenter til selvdrevne, trådløse sensorer og leverer sanntidsdata kontinuerlig. Du får full oversikt. <strong class="font-semibold text-brand-navy">Ingen kabler. Ingen batteribytter.</strong>'} />
          <span data-i18n="en" set:html={'Eldion converts lost waste heat into electricity. We transform traditional wired instruments into self-powered, wireless sensors that deliver real-time data continuously. You get full visibility. <strong class="font-semibold text-brand-navy">No cables. No battery replacements.</strong>'} />
        </p>
      </div>

      <div data-animate class="flex flex-col items-center">
        <img
          src="/images/skisse3.png"
          alt="Eldion prinsippskisse"
          class="tilt-img parallax-img w-full max-w-[420px] mix-blend-multiply"
        />
        <p class="mt-4 text-[0.7rem] tracking-wide text-brand-navy/40">
          <span data-i18n="no">Plug &amp; Play — ingen driftsstans</span><span data-i18n="en">Plug &amp; Play — no downtime</span>
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- ── Stats row ────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
    <div data-animate class="border-y border-brand-navy/[0.09] py-12">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-3 divide-x divide-brand-navy/[0.09]">

        <div class="px-4 text-center md:px-10">
          <p class="m-0 font-display text-[clamp(1.5rem,2.6vw,2.1rem)] font-bold leading-none tracking-tight text-brand-navy">
            <span class="counter-el" data-target="1200" data-suffix=" kr">0 kr</span><sup class="ml-0.5 text-xs font-semibold text-brand-orange">1</sup>
          </p>
          <p class="mt-3.5 text-[0.64rem] uppercase leading-snug tracking-[0.18em] text-brand-navy/45">
            <span data-i18n="no">per meter<br />kabling spart</span><span data-i18n="en">per metre<br />of cabling saved</span>
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="px-4 text-center md:px-10">
          <p class="m-0 font-display text-[clamp(1.5rem,2.6vw,2.1rem)] font-bold leading-none tracking-tight text-brand-navy">
            <span class="counter-el" data-target="100" data-suffix=" kg CO₂">0 kg</span><sup class="ml-0.5 text-xs font-semibold text-brand-orange">2</sup>
          </p>
          <p class="mt-3.5 text-[0.64rem] uppercase leading-snug tracking-[0.18em] text-brand-navy/45">
            <span data-i18n="no">spart per<br />installasjon</span><span data-i18n="en">saved per<br />installation</span>
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="px-4 text-center md:px-10">
          <p class="m-0 font-display text-[clamp(1.5rem,2.6vw,2.1rem)] font-bold leading-none tracking-tight text-brand-navy">
            <span data-i18n="no">&lt;1 sek</span><span data-i18n="en">&lt;1 sec</span><sup class="ml-0.5 text-xs font-semibold text-brand-orange">3</sup>
          </p>
          <p class="mt-3.5 text-[0.64rem] uppercase leading-snug tracking-[0.18em] text-brand-navy/45">
            <span data-i18n="no">sanntids<br />oppdatering</span><span data-i18n="en">real-time<br />update</span>
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ── Technical specs ─────────────────────────────────────── -->
    <div data-animate class="mb-20 mt-20 max-[768px]:mb-14 max-[768px]:mt-14">
      <p class="mb-6 text-[0.68rem] uppercase tracking-[0.26em] text-brand-navy/40">
        <span data-i18n="no">Tekniske data</span><span data-i18n="en">Technical data</span>
      </p>
      <div class="divide-y divide-brand-navy/[0.08]">

        <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-8 py-4">
          <span class="min-w-[148px] flex-shrink-0 text-sm text-brand-navy/50">
            <span data-i18n="no">Temperaturområde</span><span data-i18n="en">Temperature range</span>
          </span>
          <span class="text-right text-sm font-medium text-brand-navy" data-decrypt data-i18n="no">
            Overflate 30–250 °C · Omgivelse −20–50 °C
          </span>
          <span class="text-right text-sm font-medium text-brand-navy" data-decrypt data-i18n="en">
            Surface 30–250 °C · Ambient −20–50 °C
          </span>
        </div>

        <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-8 py-4">
          <span class="min-w-[148px] flex-shrink-0 text-sm text-brand-navy/50">
            <span data-i18n="no">Effekt ut</span><span data-i18n="en">Power output</span>
          </span>
          <span class="text-sm font-medium text-brand-navy" data-decrypt data-i18n="no">
            Testet opp til 868 mW
          </span>
          <span class="text-sm font-medium text-brand-navy" data-decrypt data-i18n="en">
            Tested up to 868 mW
          </span>
        </div>

        <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-8 py-4">
          <span class="min-w-[148px] flex-shrink-0 text-sm text-brand-navy/50">
            <span data-i18n="no">Kommunikasjon</span><span data-i18n="en">Communication</span>
          </span>
          <span class="text-sm font-medium text-brand-navy" data-decrypt data-i18n="no">
            LoRaWAN · WirelessHART · ISA100.11a · BLE
          </span>
          <span class="text-sm font-medium text-brand-navy" data-decrypt data-i18n="en">
            LoRaWAN · WirelessHART · ISA100.11a · BLE
          </span>
        </div>

        <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-8 py-4">
          <span class="min-w-[148px] flex-shrink-0 text-sm text-brand-navy/50">
            <span data-i18n="no">Montering</span><span data-i18n="en">Mounting</span>
          </span>
          <span class="text-sm font-medium text-brand-navy" data-decrypt data-i18n="no">
            Clamp-on eller magnetisk · Ingen prosessinngrep
          </span>
          <span class="text-sm font-medium text-brand-navy" data-decrypt data-i18n="en">
            Clamp-on or magnetic · No process intervention
          </span>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ── Mounting image + pilot CTA ──────────────────────────── -->
    <div class="mt-4 grid grid-cols-1 items-center gap-14 md:grid-cols-2 md:gap-16">

      <div data-animate class="text-center">
        <img
          src="/images/montering.png"
          alt="Montering"
          loading="lazy"
          class="tilt-img parallax-img mx-auto w-full max-w-[300px] rounded-2xl
                 shadow-[0_20px_48px_rgba(0,36,64,0.16)]"
        />
        <p class="mt-4 text-[0.7rem] tracking-wide text-brand-navy/40">
          <span data-i18n="no">Fleksibel overflatemontering</span><span data-i18n="en">Flexible surface mounting</span>
        </p>
      </div>

      <div data-animate>
        <p class="mb-4 text-[0.68rem] uppercase tracking-[0.26em] text-brand-blue">
          <span data-i18n="no">Pilot-partner</span><span data-i18n="en">Pilot partner</span>
        </p>
        <p class="mb-8 text-[1.02rem] leading-[1.8] text-brand-navy/70">
          <span data-i18n="no" set:html={'Vi søker innovative partnere for pilottesting. Alt vi trenger er en ΔT&nbsp;&gt;&nbsp;30&nbsp;°C. Vi tilbyr gratis installasjon og utstyr.'} />
          <span data-i18n="en" set:html={'We are looking for innovative partners for pilot testing. All we need is a ΔT&nbsp;&gt;&nbsp;30&nbsp;°C. We provide free installation and equipment.'} />
        </p>
        <a
          href="mailto:kontakt@eldion.no"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 rounded-lg border border-brand-navy/25
                 px-7 py-3.5 text-sm font-semibold text-brand-navy no-underline
                 transition-all duration-250
                 hover:bg-brand-navy hover:text-white"
        >
          <span data-i18n="no">Ta kontakt</span><span data-i18n="en">Get in touch</span>
          <i data-lucide="arrow-right" class="h-4 w-4"></i>
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- ── Footnotes ──────────────────────────────────────────── -->
    <div class="mt-16 space-y-1.5 border-t border-brand-navy/[0.08] pt-5">
      <p class="m-0 text-[0.62rem] leading-relaxed text-brand-navy/40">
        <sup class="mr-0.5 text-brand-navy/55">1</sup>
        <span data-i18n="no">En typisk kabelinstallasjon i industrien har en total kostnad på 800–1 200 kr per meter kabel installert.</span><span data-i18n="en">A typical industrial cable installation has a total cost of 800–1,200 NOK per metre of cable installed.</span>
      </p>
      <p class="m-0 text-[0.62rem] leading-relaxed text-brand-navy/40">
        <sup class="mr-0.5 text-brand-navy/55">2</sup>
        <span data-i18n="no">En typisk installasjon på 60 meter instrumentkabel vil kreve 100 kg CO₂, kun i materiale til kabelen.</span><span data-i18n="en">A typical 60-metre instrument-cable installation accounts for 100 kg CO₂ in cable material alone.</span>
      </p>
      <p class="m-0 text-[0.62rem] leading-relaxed text-brand-navy/40">
        <sup class="mr-0.5 text-brand-navy/55">3</sup>
        <span data-i18n="no">Oppdateringsfrekvens er avhengig av temperaturdifferansen.</span><span data-i18n="en">Update frequency depends on the temperature differential.</span>
      </p>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
